      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "01:05",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Honestly, on and off. Moderate, really. Only sitting in the shade, and it's not much.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:07",
      "end_timestamp": "01:14",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "What about a pounding headache, have you noticed that?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:15",
      "end_timestamp": "01:19",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, for ten days. With pounding headache, I'd call it moderate. Uh, I had heavy sweating before. That's settled now, though.",
